    "text": "A particle is given a horizontal velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math>, from the point&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&nbsp;on a smooth horizontal floor which has a vertical circular track at the end.&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is a semicircular track of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> in the vertical plane. If the path length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></math> and the particle returns to point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>, then the initial speed of the particle is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0162_34f8afce95ab.jpg\" style=\"height: 147px; width: 180px;\" />"
