    "text": "<math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></msub><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0162_f31d00146772.jpg\" style=\"height: 169px; width: 200px;\" /><br /><br />or, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />as, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br />From equation (1) <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msqrt></math>"
